<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %> - Cosmos Rewards Calculator</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand" href="/">🌌 Cosmos Rewards</a>
            <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav">
                <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
            </button>
            <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav">
                <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto">
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link <%= currentPage === 'overview' ? 'active' : '' %>" href="/">📚 Overview</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link <%= currentPage === 'calculator' ? 'active' : '' %>" href="/calculator">🧮 Calculator</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link <%= currentPage === 'code-references' ? 'active' : '' %>" href="/code-references">💻 Code References</a>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container main-content">
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <div class="row mb-5">
            <div class="col-12">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <h1 class="mb-0">🌌 How Cosmos Node Rewards Work</h1>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <p class="lead">
                            Understanding the dynamic inflation and reward mechanism in Cosmos SDK blockchains,
                            using Shardeum Cosmos as a practical example.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Core Concepts -->
        <div class="row mb-4">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="card h-100">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <h3>⚡ Validators vs Delegators</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5>🛡️ Validators</h5>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Run network infrastructure</li>
                            <li>Validate transactions and propose blocks</li>
                            <li>Earn <strong>commission</strong> from delegator rewards</li>
                            <li>Risk slashing for misbehavior</li>
                        </ul>

                        <h5 class="mt-4">👥 Delegators (Stakers)</h5>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Stake tokens to validators</li>
                            <li>Earn rewards proportional to stake</li>
                            <li>Pay validator commission</li>
                            <li>Can switch validators anytime</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="card h-100">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <h3>🔄 Reward Distribution Flow</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="alert alert-info">
                            <strong>Every Block:</strong> New tokens are minted based on current inflation rate
                        </div>

                        <ol>
                            <li><strong>Inflation mints new tokens</strong> (SHM in Shardeum)</li>
                            <li><strong>Community tax</strong> goes to governance pool (2%)</li>
                            <li><strong>Remaining 98%</strong> distributed to validators/delegators</li>
                            <li><strong>Validator commission</strong> taken first</li>
                            <li><strong>Remainder</strong> split among delegators by stake weight</li>
                        </ol>

                        <div class="calculation-formula mt-3">
                            Delegator Reward = (Block Reward × Validator Weight × (1 - Commission)) × (Your Stake / Total Validator Stake)
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Key Parameters -->
        <div class="row mb-4">
            <div class="col-12">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <h3>⚙️ Tunable Parameters (From Your Shardeum Genesis)</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <h5>🎯 Inflation Controls</h5>
                                <div class="legend-item">
                                    <div class="legend-variable">inflation_rate_change: 13%</div>
                                    <div class="legend-description">Speed of inflation adjustment (fast response)</div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="legend-item">
                                    <div class="legend-variable">inflation_max: 20%</div>
                                    <div class="legend-description">Maximum inflation when under-staked</div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="legend-item">
                                    <div class="legend-variable">inflation_min: 7%</div>
                                    <div class="legend-description">Minimum inflation when over-staked</div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="legend-item">
                                    <div class="legend-variable">goal_bonded: 67%</div>
                                    <div class="legend-description">Target staking ratio for equilibrium</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <h5>🏦 Economic Settings</h5>
                                <div class="legend-item">
                                    <div class="legend-variable">community_tax: 2%</div>
                                    <div class="legend-description">Percentage going to governance treasury</div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="legend-item">
                                    <div class="legend-variable">blocks_per_year: 6,311,520</div>
                                    <div class="legend-description">~5 second block times for precise calculations</div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="legend-item">
                                    <div class="legend-variable">max_validators: 100</div>
                                    <div class="legend-description">Active validator limit</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Self-Correcting Mechanism -->
        <div class="row mb-4">
            <div class="col-12">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <h3>🔄 Self-Correcting Economic Mechanism</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-4">
                                <div class="alert alert-warning">
                                    <h5>⬇️ Under-Staked (&lt;67%)</h5>
                                    <ul class="mb-0">
                                        <li>Inflation increases</li>
                                        <li>Higher rewards attract stakers</li>
                                        <li>Network security improves</li>
                                        <li>Example: 40% staked → ~30% APR</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-4">
                                <div class="alert alert-info">
                                    <h5>🎯 Target Staking (67%)</h5>
                                    <ul class="mb-0">
                                        <li>Inflation stable at ~13%</li>
                                        <li>Balanced security & liquidity</li>
                                        <li>Optimal network health</li>
                                        <li>Example: 67% staked → ~19% APR</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-4">
                                <div class="alert alert-success">
                                    <h5>⬆️ Over-Staked (&gt;67%)</h5>
                                    <ul class="mb-0">
                                        <li>Inflation decreases</li>
                                        <li>Lower rewards encourage unstaking</li>
                                        <li>More tokens available for DeFi</li>
                                        <li>Example: 80% staked → ~12% APR</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Foundation Steering -->
        <div class="row mb-4">
            <div class="col-12">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <h3>🎛️ Foundation Steering Mechanisms</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <h5>📊 Short-term Adjustments</h5>
                                <ul>
                                    <li><strong>Governance Proposals:</strong> Change inflation bounds (7%-20%)</li>
                                    <li><strong>Target Adjustment:</strong> Modify goal_bonded (67% → 60% or 75%)</li>
                                    <li><strong>Community Tax:</strong> Adjust treasury funding (2% → 5%)</li>
                                    <li><strong>Response Speed:</strong> Change inflation_rate_change (13% → 8%)</li>
                                </ul>

                                <div class="calculation-formula">
                                    Example: Lower goal_bonded to 60% → inflation decreases sooner → less token dilution
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <h5>🎯 Strategic Scenarios</h5>
                                <div class="legend-item">
                                    <strong>Increase Network Security:</strong><br>
                                    Raise inflation_max to 25% → Higher rewards attract more stakers
                                </div>
                                <div class="legend-item">
                                    <strong>Reduce Token Inflation:</strong><br>
                                    Lower goal_bonded to 50% → System decreases inflation earlier
                                </div>
                                <div class="legend-item">
                                    <strong>Fund Development:</strong><br>
                                    Increase community_tax to 5% → More treasury funding
                                </div>
                                <div class="legend-item">
                                    <strong>Smoother Adjustments:</strong><br>
                                    Reduce inflation_rate_change to 5% → Gentler market response
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>


        <!-- Call to Action -->
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-12 text-center">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h4>🧮 Ready to Explore the Numbers?</h4>
                        <p>Use our interactive calculator to experiment with different parameters and see how they affect rewards in real-time.</p>
                        <a href="/calculator" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Try the Calculator →</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>